umstances", "01": "situations", "10": "environments", "11": "contexts"}}, {"It": {"00": "It", "01": "This phenomenon", "10": "The situation", "11": "Climate change"}}, {"also": {"0": "also", "1": "also"}}, {"poses": {"00": "presents", "01": "constitutes", "10": "represents", "11": "entails"}}, {"significant": {"00": "considerable", "01": "substantial", "10": "notable", "11": "meaningful"}}, {"risks": {"00": "threats", "01": "hazards", "10": "dangers", "11": "perils"}}, {"to": {"0": "to", "1": "to"}}, {"human": {"00": "humankind's", "01": "people's", "10": "societal", "11": "public"}}, {"health": {"00": "well-being", "01": "healthiness", "10": "vitality", "11": "wellness"}}, {"agriculture": {"00": "farming", "01": "cultivation", "10": "husbandry", "11": "agronomy"}}, {"and": {"0": "and", "1": "and"}}, {"economies": {"00": "financial systems", "01": "commerce", "10": "markets", "11": "economic frameworks"}}, {"worldwide": {"00": "globally", "01": "internationally", "10": "around the globe", "11": "across the world"}}, {"Urgent": {"00": "Immediate", "01": "Pressing", "10": "Critical", "11": "Expedited"}}, {"action": {"00": "measures", "01": "steps", "10": "initiatives", "11": "interventions"}}, {"is": {"0": "is", "1": "is"}}, {"needed": {"00": "required", "01": "necessary", "10": "demanded", "11": "essential"}}, {"to": {"0": "to", "1": "to"}}, {"mitigate": {"00": "reduce", "01": "lessen", "10": "alleviate", "11": "diminish"}}, {"the": {"0": "the", "1": "the"}}, {"impacts": {"000": "effects", "001": "consequences", "010": "repercussions", "011": "outcomes", "100": "results", "101": "ramifications", "110": "aftermath", "111": "influences"}}, {"of": {"0": "of", "1": "of"}}, {"climate": {"00": "weather", "01": "atmospheric", "10": "meteorological", "11": "climatic"}}, {"change": {"00": "alteration", "01": "shift", "10": "transformation", "11": "modification"}}, {"and": {"0": "and", "1": "and"}}, {"protect": {"000": "safeguard", "001": "defend", "010": "preserve", "011": "shield", "100": "guard", "101": "secure", "110": "conserve", "111": "save"}}, {"our": {"0": "our", "1": "our"}}, {"planet's": {"0": "world's", "1": "earth's"}}, {"future": {"0": "prospects", "1": "tomorrow"}}], "container": "Climate change refers to the long-term alteration of Earth's climate patterns, primarily due to human activities such as the burning of fossil fuels, deforestation, and industrial processes. Its effects are far-reaching and diverse. Rising global temperatures have led to the melting of glaciers, causing sea levels to rise and coastal areas to be submerged. Extreme weather events like hurricanes, droughts, and heatwaves have become more frequent and intense. Additionally, climate change threatens biodiversity, as species struggle to adapt to rapidly changing conditions. It also poses significant risks to human health, agriculture, and economies worldwide. Urgent action is needed to mitigate the impacts of climate change and protect our planet's future.", "encoded_message": "Environmental transformation pertains to the sustained modification of planet's weather trends, chiefly attributable to civilizational pursuits such as the ignition of extinct power sources, tree-felling, and commercial methodologies. Its consequent consequences are wide-ranging and multifarious. Growing worldwide temperature levels have contributed to the softening of ice sheets, eliciting saltwater heights to soar and seashore areas to be submerged. Extreme weather events like hurricanes, droughts, and heatwaves have become more frequent and intense. Additionally, climate change threatens biodiversity, as species struggle to adapt to rapidly changing conditions. It also poses significant risks to human health, agriculture, and economies worldwide. Urgent action is needed to mitigate the impacts of climate change and protect our planet's future.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 5.26, "secret_key_generation": 107.81}, "decoding_time": 0.0003027915954589844, "d